SUMMARY:Panigiri of the Transfiguration (Sotiras)\, Xirosterni
LOCATION:Xirosterni\, Crete (Chania)\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:A small Apokoronas village with one of the area's most consistent 5–6 August panigiria: Cretan music in the square on the eve\, liturgy and a second glenti on the day itself. Expect boiled goat with pilafi\, local wine and syrtos/pentozalis\; it is a village affair\, so come with cash and no expectations of a menu.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/chania/#xirosterni-panigiri-of-the-transfiguration-sotiras-xirostern
